Package: dagLogo
Type: Package
Title: dagLogo: a Bioconductor package for visualizing conserved amino acid sequence pattern in groups based on probability theory
Version: 1.51.1
Authors@R: c(person(given="Jianhong", family="Ou", email="jou@morgridge.org", 
        role=c("aut", "cre"), comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-8652-2488")), 
        person(given="Haibo", family="Liu", role="aut"), 
